WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:07.879
Nico Robin is a special character in the story
of One Piece. I´ve always felt deeply intrigued

00:00:07.879 --> 00:00:14.080
by her personality. Because her actions invoke
a series of emotions and thoughts in me, like

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:19.090
no one else in the story does. As if there
was something about her character that was

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:24.330
speaking to me on a level that my mind wasn´t
really expecting from a story like One Piece.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:30.970
A sense of destiny and importance that usually
is reserved for no one less than the protagonist

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.949
…or maybe the antagonist. Despite being
one of the main characters of the series and

00:00:36.949 --> 00:00:42.489
holding a unique position in the world, Robin
somehow always manages to stay in the background,

00:00:42.489 --> 00:00:48.719
shrouding herself and her thoughts in deep
mystery. As a result, there are several reasons

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:54.271
why I´ve found the epithet of “light bringer”
so incredibly fitting for her character. Light

00:00:54.271 --> 00:01:00.799
bringer is the literal translation of Lucifer.
An angel fallen from god’s grace. Or in

00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:06.890
other words: The Devil. As the sole survivor
of the genocide on the island of Ohara, throughout

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:11.770
her life Robin has been marked as the “Devil
child”. An attempt by the world government

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:17.780
to silence and discredit her. Because Robin´s
knowledge and interest in the history of the

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:23.159
world is one of the, if not THE biggest threat
to the world government. Being the only person

00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:27.990
left in the world that can decipher the language
of the ancient kingdom, she is the only person

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:33.149
capable of learning the truth about the void
century. But while knowledge of the true history

00:01:33.149 --> 00:01:39.219
is something the Gorosei and Imu want to keep
buried, the Poneglyphs hold the key to even

00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:44.999
greater threats: Namely, Information on the
3 ancient weapons, that are capable of waging

00:01:44.999 --> 00:01:51.170
a war on a global scale. AND the location
of the final island in the grand line: Raftel,

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:56.969
that is closely connected to the birth of
a new pirate king. In other words, Robin is

00:01:56.969 --> 00:02:01.840
the key to everything that is a real threat
to the system of power that the world government

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:06.729
has established. The only person in the world
that can bring destruction and chaos to the

00:02:06.729 --> 00:02:13.300
world order they built for the past 900 years.
It is no wonder then, that Robin is seen as

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:19.000
the “Devil” of the One-Piece world. The
person capable of breaking the wheel, if you

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:25.640
want. Good thing Robin doesn´t have a dragon
though. Ironically enough though, all these

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:31.900
reasons have also led to Robin´s second epithet:
“The light of the revolution”. Her unique

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:37.070
skills and positioning in the world have become
a source of hope in the opposition to the

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:43.420
world government, the revolutionaries. Without
her, the world will most likely never be changed.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:48.540
So, while Robin is the Lucifer to the world
government, she is also the light of hope

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:54.590
for the revolutionaries, fighting for a better
world. I think, calling Robin the “light-bringer”

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:59.720
reflects really well on her character being
a two-sided coin. Since we have no real idea

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:04.630
of what Robin already knows about the world
and how she plans on using that knowledge,

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:10.780
she is a real wildcard in the story that could
get grave importance at any moment. Combined

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:16.100
with her calm and quiet personality, I think
it is fair to say, that maybe next to Zoro,

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:20.300
she is the most mysterious of the Straw hats,
since there is so little, we truly know about

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:27.130
her. So, who is Robin, and what makes her
character so unique in the story of one piece?

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:32.010
The way we got introduced to Robin was very
different from anything we had gotten for

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:37.910
any of the other straw hats up to that point:
Robin was a mysterious and immensely interesting

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:43.190
antagonist of the straw hats during the baroque
work arc. Her contradictive actions, helping

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:48.750
the straw hats in some ways while then opposing
them again in others, lead to a quick fascination

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:54.180
with her character for me. Only slowly do
we learn that Robin only joined forces with

00:03:54.180 --> 00:04:00.760
the Warlord Crocodile to follow her own ambitions.
The image we get of her is that of a ruthless

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:06.380
assassin, that uses any means necessary to
get what she wants. So, despite Luffy´s kindness

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:11.580
towards her, it was a true twist in the story,
when she suddenly appeared on the ship, inviting

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:17.380
herself to join the crew. In retrospect however,
I think it makes a lot of sense that Luffy

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:22.480
saved and accepted Robin on his ship. Because,
as we learned from Rayleigh during the time

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:29.300
skip, Luffy has the ability to sense a person´s
true intentions. So, while Luffy was already

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:34.710
aware of Robin´s true nature, it took us
a whole lot more to truly understand Robin´s

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:40.070
character and motivations. And I dare say,
that this process led to some of the best

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:45.180
arcs in the story. The timing and pace that
Oda used to place Nico Robin in the story

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:50.690
was simply amazing when looking at the story
up until the time skip. Having a mysterious

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:56.750
and complex antagonist, with a cool and dark
vibe, turn into an ally and then slowly revealing

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:01.540
the history and impact of that character?
Everything about this character introduced

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:06.889
a new level of complexity and heaviness on
the story, that didn´t really exist up to

00:05:06.889 --> 00:05:12.280
this point. Robin´s past, the genocide of
her people, her lifelong run from the grasps

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:17.060
of the world government and the loneliness
and heartbreak she experienced, really hammered

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:22.470
in what One Piece was going to be about in
the long run. With Robin, we were introduced

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:28.010
to the Poneglyphs and with them to the mystery
of the ancient kingdom, it´s weapons and

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:32.860
the source of injustice in the world. With
the introduction of the CP9, we were shown

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:38.540
the cruelty and ruthlessness with which the
government operates and how corrupt and unjust

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:45.680
the entire system was. With Robin, One Piece
changed its nature and scale completely. It

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:49.750
went from a young boy, trying to find the
ultimate treasure in a world of pirates together

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.720
with his friends, to a political and complex
story about healing the world and breaking

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:58.530
the unjust and cruel system under which, the
world is suffering.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:03.520
Robin as a character is constructed in a way,
that mirrors everything that is wrong with

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:08.410
the current system. When she joins the crew,
her greatest weaknesses are her deep lack

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:14.060
of trust in anyone but herself, a great lack
of self-confidence self-worth and a strong

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:20.480
sense of loneliness and isolation. All these
things can easily be tracked back to her past.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:24.690
While she had already been tormented by her
uncle and his wife and feared by the other

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:29.450
children for her devil fruit powers, it took
the entire cruelty of the world government

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:35.710
to rob young Robin from all positivity and
hope. First her mother and everyone she knew

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:40.590
were murdered in front of her eyes. Then they
brainwashed the public into believing that

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:45.110
Robin was the last survivor of a group that
was trying to destroy the world, by finding

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:50.960
the ancient weapons. They robbed her of any
chance of refuge or care. So, Robin had to

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:57.650
grow up on her own, hiding and on the run.
As a result, Robin has a clear moral problem

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:03.410
that her character needs to solve. Her inability
to trust and open up to others keeps her from

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:09.080
following the path she actually wants to go,
learn and live in peace. While she is actually

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:14.610
a very kind hearted and caring person, her
tragic past has forced her to put up a wall

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:19.840
around herself that keeps her from making
any friends. Since she doesn´t trust anyone,

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:25.000
she ends up hurting those around her as well
by manipulating and using them for her own

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:29.800
interests. When she is taken by the CP9, even
though she wants to protect the crew, her

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:34.400
inability to share her thoughts and feelings
with others, end up hurting her friends. The

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:39.380
big challenge for Robin´s character was therefore
to overcome this wall she has built around

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:44.630
herself and once again allow herself to open
up and trust others.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:49.270
On the surface, at first glance, Robin´s
dream doesn´t really seem to be connected

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:54.590
to this need. Her dream is to learn the true
history of the world and uncover what was

00:07:54.590 --> 00:08:00.300
lost and hidden. Given her heritage of Ohara
and her passion for archeology, this of course

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:05.449
makes sense. And I hope you agree with me,
when I say that Robin´s dream is a lot more

00:08:05.449 --> 00:08:10.949
relevant to the actual plot than some of the
other straw hat´s. Compared to Brook or Sanji

00:08:10.949 --> 00:08:17.110
for example, who´s dreams are more personal,
Robin´s dream is directly connected to opposing

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:22.650
the strongest political and military force
on the planet. Her dream goes hand in hand

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:27.730
with reaching Raftel and making Luffy the
pirate king. I had a real click-moment in

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:32.990
my head when I saw how perfectly that dream
fit in with her character. But going back

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:38.459
to her moral problem, Robin also has a second
dream, that is actually on a more personal

00:08:38.459 --> 00:08:44.720
level. Robin wants to find someone to protect.
And in that sense, she is already in the unique

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:49.290
position, where she is aware of her moral
problem. Something that usually takes a very

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:55.379
impactful event to uncover. In Robin´s case
though, it simply shows how deep her vulnerability

00:08:55.379 --> 00:09:00.199
goes. Even though she knows that she wants
to love and trust someone, she has suffered

00:09:00.199 --> 00:09:05.249
too much to overcome it herself.
Both of these dreams also go really well hand

00:09:05.249 --> 00:09:10.089
in hand with the values that Robin holds.
As we keep learning over the course of the

00:09:10.089 --> 00:09:15.550
story, Robin is a much more positive person,
than she appeared at the beginning. She actually

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:21.829
strongly values trust, kindness and relationships
in general. Her twisted sense of humor seems

00:09:21.829 --> 00:09:26.899
to be a result of these ideals and the harsh
reality she had to live in. Being a woman

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:33.389
of science, similar to Chopper, she also highly
values knowledge and the way it is used. Also,

00:09:33.389 --> 00:09:38.751
as you know, being the most political amongst
the crew, Robin dearly values peace. Which

00:09:38.751 --> 00:09:43.040
is why we can see Robin at her happiest when
she is reading a book on board of the ship

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:49.241
out at sea. Most importantly though, Robin
finally learns to value life. Not only that

00:09:49.241 --> 00:09:55.149
of others, but especially her own. Which is
one of the greatest moral messages of Oda

00:09:55.149 --> 00:10:02.020
in the entire story I feel. Because being
able to love yourself for who you are is probably

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:07.440
the most important factor in growing as a
person and finding happiness.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:12.790
Based on these values and her past, Robin
is an incredibly intelligent and knowledgeable

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:18.179
character. Being at the center of political
interest, she probably has the most realistic

00:10:18.179 --> 00:10:23.619
and complete view of the world in the crew.
And having to survive all this time by herself,

00:10:23.619 --> 00:10:29.310
she has learned to play smart and dirty if
necessary. Together with her calm and collected

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:34.970
manner and her, for me personally, hilarious
dark humor, I would say she has developed

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:39.339
a really strong personality.
And since she plays such an important role

00:10:39.339 --> 00:10:45.269
in the story, Robin has gathered a number
of powerful opponents, that only maybe Luffy

00:10:45.269 --> 00:10:51.889
can come close to. Being on the top wanted
list of the World Government and all its organizations,

00:10:51.889 --> 00:10:57.949
Robin has enemies all over the world, including
the citizens. Additionally, Pirates and other

00:10:57.949 --> 00:11:04.009
Organizations also crave her skills, putting
her at danger anywhere she goes. To best illustrate

00:11:04.009 --> 00:11:09.660
how all of these factors come together in
the story, let´s look at Robin´s character

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:13.240
arc.
I think it will not come as a big surprise

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:17.899
to you when I tell you that Robin´s main
character arc took place over the course of

00:11:17.899 --> 00:11:23.899
2 major arcs: The Baroque Work Saga and the
Water 7 and Ennis Lobby Saga. First being

00:11:23.899 --> 00:11:29.860
introduced as an antagonist, we got to know
of Robin´s dark and mysterious side. Basically,

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:35.329
the result of her tragic past. Her character
only begins to truly change though, when she

00:11:35.329 --> 00:11:40.790
is rescued by Luffy from the tomb in Alabasta.
Upon deciding to join the crew, since she

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:45.970
had nowhere to go, Robin slowly starts to
experience friendship and kindness, as she

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:51.149
hasn´t since she met Saul on Ohara. She was
slowly accepted by the crew, and even though

00:11:51.149 --> 00:11:55.709
she didn´t truly feel like a part of them,
she still learned to appreciate this new and

00:11:55.709 --> 00:12:00.620
positive environment she found herself in.
So after simply being a normal part of the

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:05.430
crew for the entirety of the Skypeia arc,
Robin started to feel connected to the crew.

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:10.200
Her moral problem and lack of self-confidence
though, lead her to leave the crew behind,

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.310
to protect them from the influence of the
world government. She wanted to shield the

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:18.880
straw hats from the greater scheme of things
and keep them out of the world politics and

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:25.199
safe from prosecution. By Oda making Ennis
Lobby into a major developing arc for the

00:12:25.199 --> 00:12:30.420
entire crew, he made the message to Robin
even more powerful. Her friends would not

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:36.170
only stand behind her but overcome their limits
and become stronger just for her sake. They

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:41.620
were prepared to take on the biggest power
in the world just for her. Luffy did not simply

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:47.459
put her above his interests. He made her part
of them. The entirety of the Ennis Lobby arc

00:12:47.459 --> 00:12:52.999
is simply amazing, how Oda was able to bring
together so many different elements and push

00:12:52.999 --> 00:12:59.149
the story in so many ways, all by creating
Robin the way she is. So, when she sees, how

00:12:59.149 --> 00:13:03.860
important she actually is to others, she is
finally able to overcome her inability to

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:09.980
put trust and hope into others and opens herself
up to the straw hats. I think it is no surprise

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:14.629
then, that this moment is one of the most
impactful ones in the entire story (Audio

00:13:14.629 --> 00:13:19.720
+ pic). At the same time Robin is able to
achieve one of her dreams and has finally

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:24.879
found someone she can protect and care for.
She was truly able to challenge her basic

00:13:24.879 --> 00:13:29.889
beliefs and, in the end, managed to overcome
her weaknesses and break down her wall. I

00:13:29.889 --> 00:13:34.929
can say with confidence, that Robin´s character
arc up until the time skip is one of my favorite

00:13:34.929 --> 00:13:38.991
ones in fiction.
So, if you watched my video on Chopper, you

00:13:38.991 --> 00:13:44.311
probably know what is coming now. Because
same as Chopper, I feel like Robin´s character

00:13:44.311 --> 00:13:50.410
has a big problem. Because in more than just
one way her character arc has already finished

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:55.110
by the time skip. And I do not complain about
that, as I just said, I believe her arc was

00:13:55.110 --> 00:14:00.839
simply incredibly and greatly set up by Oda.
The problem is that I don´t see anything

00:14:00.839 --> 00:14:06.619
new happening with Robin. Similar to Chopper
she has lost her mysterious and cool vibe

00:14:06.619 --> 00:14:11.279
and has now become someone with a funny hat
that keeps in the background most of the time

00:14:11.279 --> 00:14:16.639
and smiles. It sometimes literally feels like
Oda has sucked all excitement out of this

00:14:16.639 --> 00:14:22.790
amazing character. And especially in Robin´s
case I feel that that is such a waste. Because

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:27.480
her character is so complex and has so many
sides, that there was more than one option

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:32.129
to keep Robin relevant and fascinating. Isn't
her character interesting enough to serve

00:14:32.129 --> 00:14:36.939
as more than a technical piece in reaching
Raftel and learning the truth? Because even

00:14:36.939 --> 00:14:41.160
though Robin has changed, the fact that she
is still one of the most notoriously wanted

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:46.940
people in the world, shouldn´t have changed.
Robin has so many capabilities and yet never

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:51.879
has played any major role in any arc since
the time skip. She is so well versed in the

00:14:51.879 --> 00:14:57.449
political structures of the world and part
of the underworld herself. And yet in Dressrosa

00:14:57.449 --> 00:15:01.000
as well as in Whole Cake Island, where the
underworld and political structures played

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:06.519
such a big role, she didn´t play any. And
apart from that, Robin has one of the most

00:15:06.519 --> 00:15:12.759
amazing Devil Fruits in the story. She could
literally spy on anyone, by creating eyes.

00:15:12.759 --> 00:15:17.660
She can create clones, but only uses them
in very limited ways. She could maybe create

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:22.720
additional muscles to power up her physical
strength. But how does it fit her smart and

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:27.660
witty character that she decided to use her
fruit to make giant arms and legs that aimlessly

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:33.459
stomp around? Isn´t that rather something
Luffy or Franky would do? With all the opportunities

00:15:33.459 --> 00:15:39.199
this fruit has? Especially for her character?
Outside and inside of combat this power could

00:15:39.199 --> 00:15:44.629
be used so much smarter. Even though I think
her character change was handled amazingly,

00:15:44.629 --> 00:15:48.680
I don´t think that overcoming her weaknesses
and finding friends necessarily had to mean

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:54.589
turning her into a plain character. Why not
keep her edge and sinister vibe? Her smooth,

00:15:54.589 --> 00:16:00.329
confident, attractive &amp; dangerous personality
is gone and she is now easily overshadowed

00:16:00.329 --> 00:16:06.079
by strong personalities like Luffy, Zoro or
even Usopp. Now don´t get me wrong, as we

00:16:06.079 --> 00:16:10.939
have established before, Robin still has to
play an important role in the story. We pretty

00:16:10.939 --> 00:16:15.149
much don´t know what she was up to with the
revolutionaries during the time skip and she

00:16:15.149 --> 00:16:20.339
might very well still keep her secrets. She
will play a decisive role in tumbling the

00:16:20.339 --> 00:16:25.959
world government and maybe even in creating
a new and just world order. But I still wish

00:16:25.959 --> 00:16:31.139
that Oda would have left some of the fascination
I her character and gave her some new character

00:16:31.139 --> 00:16:36.850
arc in the new world. Because Robin is the
light bringer. The Devil for the world government

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:41.439
and the light of the revolution. And I think
both of these roles deserve a little more

00:16:41.439 --> 00:16:45.549
attention and development. And maybe a new
leather jacket.

